<h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #0f172a; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px;">Hello {{userName}},</h2>
<p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0;">A new support ticket has been assigned to you.</p>

<div style="background-color: #f8fafc; padding: 16px; border-left: 4px solid {{brand.accent}}; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;">
  <strong style="color: #334155;">Ticket:</strong> {{ticketTitle}}<br>
  <strong style="color: #334155;">Priority:</strong> {{#if priority}}{{priority}}{{else}}MEDIUM{{/if}}
</div>

<p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">Please click the button below to view the ticket details and begin working on it.</p>
